OL,3,GNEWSARogue trader jailed after scamming
OL,4,Avictims of #128k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prolific rogue trader who took more
OL,7,Fthan #128,000 in deposits for building
OL,8,Fwork he never completed has been
OL,9,Fjailed.
OL,11,FPaul Bagley, 43, of Robin Avenue,
OL,12,FHarleston, Norfolk, took the money from
OL,13,F13 customers in Norfolk and Suffolk,
OL,14,Fwhose losses ranged from #450 to
OL,15,F#36,050.
OL,17,FOne victim said they would "never trust
OL,18,Fanyone again" and another said "it
OL,19,Fmakes me feel sick that he took
OL,20,Fadvantage", Ipswich Crown Court was
OL,21,Ftold.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
